{"id":"main_2_level_main_02-03_beg","steps":[{"t":"cmd","c":"header","a":{"key":"title_test","is_skippable":true,"fit_mode":"BLACK_MASK"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta1_180603/m_sys_loading_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta1_180603/m_sys_loading_loop","volume":0.8,"crossfade":1.5,"delay":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_lungmen_b","width":1,"height":1,"fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_012_misa_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"Hurry, hide!"},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"I... I need to go."},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"Take this... this is for you."},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"This is a protective charm. My mother taught me how to make these..."},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"And this is one that I made."},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"When you make these dolls by hand, you can keep the ones you care about safe."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"line","name":"Children","text":"Okay, sister Misha, we'll take good care of it!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_012_misa_1#3"}},{"t":"line","name":"Misha","text":"Good, good."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_012_misa_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Misha","text":"Now, go hide! And don't make a sound."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"line","name":"Children","text":"Okay!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"initr":2,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_soldiersrun"}},{"t":"line","name":"Rioter","text":"Where'd they go? ! After them! Let's see how far those Infected can run!"},{"t":"line","name":"Rioter","text":"Hmm? Now... what do we have here?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"initr":2,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"According to Exusiai's data, our mission target should have been staying somewhere around here..."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Argh, the terrain around here is really complicated. If we were doing this alone, this assignment might have been quite troublesome..."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Luckily, I got in touch with Penguin Logistics beforehand..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#6"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"...Who's there?"},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Those people are...!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"line","name":"Child","text":"Baddies! You bunch of baddies! Let go of me! Let... Go...!"},{"t":"line","name":"Rioter","text":"Tell me! Where'd she run off to?"},{"t":"line","name":"Rioter","text":"Stop playing dumb!"},{"t":"line","name":"Child","text":"Sister! Sister! Where are you...! Help..."},{"t":"line","name":"Child","text":"Sister Misha! Sister Misha, save me!!"},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"line","name":"Rioter","text":"Who is it?"},{"t":"line","name":"Rioter","text":"Get back here!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7","fadetime":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"..."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"...You should leave right now if you know what's good for you."},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"line","name":"Rioter","text":"...?!"},{"t":"line","name":"Rioter","text":"Who the hell...?!"},{"t":"line","name":"Rioter","text":"You don't like you're from around here!"},{"t":"line","name":"Rioter","text":"You're not afraid of us..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Player/p_skill/p_skill_spiritexplo","volume":0.4}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Otherwise..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"line","name":"Rioter","text":"Huh?"},{"t":"line","name":"Rioter","text":"Gaaah!!"},{"t":"line","name":"Rioter","text":"Wh-what was that?"},{"t":"line","name":"Rioter","text":"Arts! Sh-she's using Arts?!"},{"t":"line","name":"Rioter","text":"Aaaargh! Stay away from me!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"block":true,"fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"...Don't bully the defenseless ever again."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":1,"xstrength":3,"ystrength":4,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"line","name":"Rioter","text":"Aaaagh! Monster!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_soldiersrun","volume":0.4}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":1,"xstrength":5,"ystrength":6,"vibrato":90,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Heh... Monster, huh?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#6"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Everything will be okay. You can come out now."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"It's dangerous here. You should hurry and find some place safe."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"line","name":"Children","text":"Thank you, ma'am!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Take care!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_walk_n"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_106_franka_1","fadetime":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Franka","text":"Amiya, what's going on?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_106_franka_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Hm, I saw an Infected just now, probably unregistered..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_106_franka_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Franka","text":"From Ursus?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_106_franka_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Yes. She was heading deeper into the slums."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Franka, gather the nearby operators."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_106_franka_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Franka","text":"Okay."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"The deeper we head into the slums, the more volatile things are going to be..."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"There are ordinary civilians, criminals, and refugees - all mixed together."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"We'll have to make thorough preparations."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_107_liskam_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Liskarm","text":"Amiya, we have incoming comms."},{"t":"line","name":"Liskarm","text":"Please wait a second."},{"t":"line","name":"Liskarm","text":"..."},{"t":"line","name":"Liskarm","text":"That's right."},{"t":"line","name":"Liskarm","text":"Amiya, it's the L.G.D."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_107_liskam_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Was that Madam Ch'en?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_107_liskam_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Liskarm","text":"Indeed."},{"t":"line","name":"Liskarm","text":"... That's right. We've already found a number of unregistered Infected."},{"t":"line","name":"Liskarm","text":"... Yes."},{"t":"line","name":"Liskarm","text":"... What?"},{"t":"line","name":"Liskarm","text":"... We're after an Ursus girl, short white hair, height of about 145 cm, called Misha?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_107_liskam_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"That's...?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_107_liskam_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Liskarm","text":"...Understood."},{"t":"line","name":"Liskarm","text":"Amiya, Madam Ch'en wants us to immediately search for the Infected just described."},{"t":"line","name":"Liskarm","text":"Once we find her, we are to turn her in to the L.G.D. immediately."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_107_liskam_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Can I speak to her please?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Hello, hello..."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Madam Ch'en, can you hear me?"},{"t":"unknown","c":"charactercutin","a":{"widgetid":"1","name":"char_010_chen_1","style":"cutin","fadestyle":"horiz_expand_center","fadetime":0.5,"offsetx":-300,"width":200,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":"Ch'en","text":"I hear you."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Can I confirm the validity of that order?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","focus":0}},{"t":"line","name":"Ch'en","text":"100% valid, effective immediately."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"I see."},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_transmissionget","volume":0.4}},{"t":"unknown","c":"charactercutin","a":{"widgetid":"1","fadetime":0.5,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"..."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"She suddenly hung up..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_106_franka_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Franka","text":"That Ch'en, she's got a bit of a temper."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"So this is going to be our mission for now..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_107_liskam_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Liskarm","text":"Amiya, I've just received another message from several defenders."},{"t":"line","name":"Liskarm","text":"They met some individuals who were openly hostile to Rhodes Island's operators."},{"t":"line","name":"Liskarm","text":"Furthermore, those attackers weren't ordinary people, they were... Infected."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#6"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"delay":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"... Have the defenders fall back towards us."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Scout team! Our target is an Ursine girl with short white hair, height of 145 cm. Remember to stay hidden, and stay safe!"},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Other operators, follow your leaders and spread out."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"decision","options":["It'd be best to stall them out.","So we're... going to lure them in?","Franka, let's attack them head-on."],"values":["1","2","3"]},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1","2","3"]},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_106_franka_1","name2":"char_107_liskam_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Franka","text":"Hey... Not bad."},{"t":"line","name":"Franka","text":"Liskarm, this kid's pretty smart."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_106_franka_1","name2":"char_107_liskam_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Liskarm","text":"... Dr. {@nickname} is our tactical commander. You should take this more seriously."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Let's begin."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"So... Rhodes Island has to fight against the Infected again..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{}}]}
